    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant, scarcely populated world. A conflict is brewing between multiple factions vying for control over valuable resources. Tasked with enforcing order on behalf of one of the mining corporations, you find yourself stumbling upon a life-changing discovery\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unit Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lets you design units from the ground up, block by block. The most basic structural blocks can have their shapes altered using an easy-to-use shape sculpting system. The weapons too are not fixed and can be crafted from multiple component types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design influences every aspect of the unit from its handling, speed and stability to damage, health and armor stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657500/extras/7ed31dbecbf07905b1c195bc8e1f1dd8.avif?t=1744392628\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design units from the ground up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of propulsion options including wheels, treads, walker legs and rocket engines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust and easy-to-use shape sculpting system that enables the player to extensively customize the look of the units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weapon crafting system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base-building mechanics characteristic of classic real-strategy games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom games modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant, scarcely populated world. A conflict is brewing between multiple factions vying for control over valuable resources. Tasked with enforcing order on behalf of one of the mining corporations, you find yourself stumbling upon a life-changing discovery\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unit Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lets you design units from the ground up, block by block. The most basic structural blocks can have their shapes altered using an easy-to-use shape sculpting system. The weapons too are not fixed and can be crafted from multiple component types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design influences every aspect of the unit from its handling, speed and stability to damage, health and armor stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657500/extras/7ed31dbecbf07905b1c195bc8e1f1dd8.avif?t=1744392628\" data-has-big width=800 height=343 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design units from the ground up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of propulsion options including wheels, treads, walker legs and rocket engines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust and easy-to-use shape sculpting system that enables the player to extensively customize the look of the units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weapon crafting system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base-building mechanics characteristic of classic real-strategy games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom games modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Uncrewed 2 is a real-time strategy game that lets the player design units from the ground up. Wheels, treads, walker legs, and rocket engines - the game offers a variety of propulsion options, as well as the ability to craft your own weapons.",
